      "content": "but that's the thing though. if i'm the one keeping the cycle going, then maybe the only way to actually stop it is to just... not be part of it anymore. if i'm gone, the pattern stops with me. it feels like the only way i can actually do something good for my family is to make sure nothing else passes on through me.",
